==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 50~60 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pigge Victorious]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns.
**1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns.
**1 [[Pigge Back]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

